# Binary types. Declaring them keeps git from attempting line-ending conversion
# or producing a textual diff for a file that has none. Mirrors the outer
# research_stuff repository's root .gitattributes.
#
# `* text=auto` is deliberately NOT set here either: see
# docs/REPOSITORY_HYGIENE.md in the outer repository for the test to run before
# adding it.

*.pdf   binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.svg   -text
*.pt    binary
*.npy   binary
*.npz   binary
*.pkl   binary
*.pickle binary
*.tgz   binary
*.tar   binary
*.gz    binary
*.zst   binary
*.whl   binary
*.pptx  binary
*.docx  binary
*.xlsx  binary
*.zip   binary
*.woff2 binary
*.so    binary
